        "created_at": "2013-08-27T13:23:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is anyone else bothered by the kerning in the title of the game on the box? &nbsp;Visually, it looks like there's too much space between the \"L\" and the \"T\" of \"MULTIVERSE\". &nbsp;It's an annoying flaw in a game that otherwise looks great.</p><p>(Not sure which forum this belongs in.)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:08.267Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
